<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 156 0 R
/T (Many satellite images are collected every day, and organizing them manually is difficult. Clustering helps automatically group similar images. However, simple clustering methods do not work well for complex image data. In this project, we use spectral clustering and improve it using a density-adaptive graph method to achieve better clustering performance.)
/E (Many satellite images are collected every day, and organizing them manually is difficult. Clustering helps automatically group similar images. However, simple clustering methods do not work well for complex image data. In this project, we use spectral clustering and improve it using a density-adaptive graph method to achieve better clustering performance.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
